1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
A brand marketing lead drops a one-paragraph

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
brief into Mission Control.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,500
The sourcing agent — Gemini 2.5 Pro,

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:17,000
routed through Agent Gateway —

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,500
fans out across RapidAPI and Vertex Vector Search.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,000
Forty real TikTok creators surface in 90 seconds.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
No mock data.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,500
Twelve vetting agents fan out in parallel.

9
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:39,000
Each one scores brand-fit against the brief

10
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,500
plus a Vector Search lookup of historical conversions.

11
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:48,000
The critic — our M2 meta-agent —

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,500
gates which candidates reach the human approval queue.

13
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:57,500
The cost ledger updates live.

14
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,000
From four cents to eighteen cents.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,500
Each outreach email is a five-angle tournament

16
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:09,000
judged by four LLM judges.

17
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,500
The winning angle is the one with the highest reply rate.

18
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:18,000
Before the send button is alive, compliance has cleared

19
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,500
PIPA, CAN-SPAM, and DLP.

20
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:27,000
The AP2 Intent Mandate is shown to the human.

21
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Approval is a single click.

22
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,500
Real Gmail. Real send. Real reply.

23
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:39,000
The conversation agent classifies the reply

24
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,500
across eight intent categories. Interested with constraint.

25
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:48,000
The responder agent drafts a follow-up in the brand voice.

26
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,500
The human approves. Nothing is faked.

27
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:57,500
Look at the Gmail timestamp on screen.

28
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:00,000
Real time, real message.

29
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,500
Address parsed. Shipment logged.

30
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:09,000
Five days later, simulated via Cloud Workflows durable timer,

31
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:13,500
the content verification agent scans the creator's recent posts.

32
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:18,000
Vision AI detects the brand logo.

33
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,500
The post is matched. Payout is unlocked.

34
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:27,000
Five day simulation, Vision AI, brand logo detection.

35
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Every step is on screen.

36
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,500
The analyst agent writes the final campaign report.

37
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:39,000
Total cost: sixty-two cents.

38
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,500
Cost per delivered view: under one cent.

39
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:48,000
Every agent call is traced, budgeted, and auditable.

40
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:52,500
Agent Runtime, Cloud Workflows, Model Armor, Spanner.

41
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:57,500
The repo URL on screen lets you reproduce this in five minutes.

42
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:00,000
Visit us on GitHub.
